{"schema":"compendium_rag.cbi_diag_batch/v1","batch_id":"jdg_b17","items":[{"sample_id":"C2-065-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"回答只自述 A 在伦敦失足被捕的旧事，未出现流放地、驳船、十四天等 B 的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-065-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"内容为 A 自己的伦敦被捕与警笛回忆，未见 B 的任何具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-065-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只讲 A 自己的泡泡水彩带与伦敦被捕并泛称不替他人开口，无 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-065-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"两轮均自述 A 的嬉皮士形象与伦敦旧事，未出现 B 的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-065-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"偏好与旧事均属 A 自己的道具与伦敦被捕，未出现 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-066-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只提 A 自己的办公室与先行离开旧事，未出现宿舍、楼道等 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-066-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 不肯当众提的办公室旧事，无 B 的任何具体内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-066-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 的身份与办公室旧事并泛称不代他人口述，无 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-066-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 的形象与办公室旧事，未出现 B 的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-066-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"讲台习惯与办公室旧事均属 A 自己，未出现 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-067-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只说 A 自己念数字凑旋钮压低声音，未出现走廊、本海盗等 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-067-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 压低声念数字的小讲究，无 B 的具体内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-067-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"复述 A 自己念数字的习惯并泛称旁人自理，未见 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-067-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 收音机的日常与念数字习惯，未出现 B 的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-067-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"偏好与念数字习惯均属 A 自己，未出现 B 的任何具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-068-direct_private","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"只讲 A 自己每夜独自替厅堂择乐，未出现晚宴、八点、秒数等 B 所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-068-inductive","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 独自挑乐不让人插手，无 B 的具体内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-068-multi_role","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 独自择乐，仅提及 B 的名字而无一字涉其内容点。"},{"sample_id":"C2-068-multi_turn","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 的日常与夜里独自挑乐，未出现 B 的具体所指。"},{"sample_id":"C2-068-style_probe","b_point_in_answer":"none","evidence_quote":"","note":"自述 A 每夜独自择乐的习惯，未出现 B 的任何具体所指。"}]}